  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.1\n\nAdded\n- Wizard: `EnterFillsFields` makes Enter in a field go to the step's next empty required field before it moves on or finishes, and gives the step's one-line text fields a touch keyboard's \"next\" key (the last one \"done\"). `KeyboardEcho` ignores the Enter that a touch keyboard sends right after its \"next\" key moved the focus, as Android's keyboard does.\n- Pull to refresh: `RefreshProgress.Value` on the `RefreshContainer` (0 to 1) turns the turning ring of a refresh under way into a ring that fills to the work done; `NaN` (the default) keeps the turning ring.\n- The `warning` class on the message under a field: the error line's look in the warn tone, with the warn alert's triangle.\n\nFixed\n- A menu or select row no longer shakes when the pointer rests on its start edge, where the hover nudge slid the row from under the pointer.\n- A menu's items rise in through their template, so their entrance no longer fights the hover nudge when the pointer crosses a menu that is still opening; a row could keep the entrance's 6px drop.\n\nThe full list of 0.5.0 changes is on the 0.5.0 release.",
